      "writtenOn": "2018-09-26T19:58:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, we only need to wait after initially changing Rp.  With the way the code is currently set up, we *should* only be calling this when we start an AMS, and the after it\u0027s complete we\u0027ll transition back into the ready state before we start another AMS.  \n\nIf we want to be extra safe, we could add a CC check before this point in sink_can_xmit().",
      "parentUuid": "28a4a897_ee0337a8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 360,
        "startChar": 2,
