        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-09-26T19:28:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is definitely one of the exit conditions. I am a little nervous that we may not end an AMS this way and our cc lines are incorrect, maybe a PR_SWAP (since we will end in the SNK_READY state)?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 672,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 672,
        "endChar": 35
